---
layout: base.njk
title: Lick Library
description: Free guitar licks with full video lessons and downloadable tabs. New licks added regularly.
permalink: /licks/
---
<header class="notes-header">
  <h1>Lick Library</h1>
  <p>Free guitar licks with a full video lesson and downloadable tab for each one. Pick a technique, learn the lick, take it to your own playing.</p>
</header>
<ul class="notes-list">
  {% for lick in collections.licks %}
  <li class="notes-list-item">
    <a href="{{ lick.url }}">
      <h2>{{ lick.data.title }}</h2>
      {% if lick.data.summary %}<p>{{ lick.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      <div class="notes-list-foot">
        <span class="meta">
          {%- if lick.data.technique %}{{ lick.data.technique }}{% endif -%}
          {%- if lick.data.key %} &middot; {{ lick.data.key }}{% endif -%}
        </span>
        <span class="notes-list-read">Open lesson &#8594;</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
